  - speakerName: 'Jewel:'
    line: "\u201CNate? He would swing by at least twice a week to get me to fix up
      something he busted on his gear. Kept telling him he needed to give the girl
      a bit more love or else she was going to give out on him. But I haven't seen
      him today,chances are he'll stroll up later with a leaky hose or something
      like that.\u201D"
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    attemptTurnIn: 0
    changeSceneAfter: 0
    sceneToLoad: 
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: '"Ok, if you see him, tell him I was looking for him."'
